[{:db/id "q-48185/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "9b8fab6f-aca5-52b4-b15d-92ee62b3dce4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "affa023e-bb08-5ae6-8a22-9a891c5ca989" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "6a0a698b-3217-5b50-9a60-41731e74c9d0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "51e4dd83-11ee-5e48-bd18-8e4ca3aa0536" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "d33fa08c-b5fe-556c-a129-d1c033ee5349" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "48a2be45-bbd2-5c69-a58d-3dbde385d018" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-48185/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer-field/choices ["q-48185/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-48185/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-48185/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" "q-48185/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-48185/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-48185" :question/id #uuid "825ab862-b738-5389-82d3-382684f52334" :question/math-academy-id "q-48185" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14040492/assets/786d223be90c13335ab80672631dcbef25297688ae9e318928e744ebbf8a5cdf.png)\n\nWhich of the following statements are true regarding the function $y=f(x)$ plotted above?\n\n- It has a jump discontinuity at $x=-1.$\n- It has a removable discontinuity at $x=-1.$\n- It is continuous at $x=-1.$" :question/worked-solution "The function has a jump discontinuity at $x=-1.$ Checking our conditions, we see that\n\n- $f(-1)=2$ exists, $\\,\\,✓$\n\n- ${lim}_{x\\to -1}f(x)$ does not exist $\\,\\,\\times $\n\nSo the second condition failed. It failed because the left and right-sided limits are not equal:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{-}}f(x)=1,\\,\\,{lim}_{x\\to (-1)^{+}}f(x)=2.\n$$\n\nThese limits both exist and are finite, yet they are not equal. Therefore, the discontinuity at $x=-1$ is a jump discontinuity.\n\nConsequently, I is true, and II and III are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-48185/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07b63c0c-daaa-5f5b-acb3-58d6f36ee869"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-48185"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-38712/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "d815f591-412a-5394-a1bf-040363ef8624" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38712/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "64798606-8a72-5282-b35b-be61e6948047" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-38712/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "63277236-585a-580d-bee0-d62bddfcbe9e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value