es $\n\nSo the second condition failed. It failed because the left and right-sided limits are not equal:\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {2}^{-}}f(x)=2,\\,\\,{lim}_{x\\to {2}^{+}}f(x)=3.\n$$\n\nThese limits both exist and are finite, yet they are not equal. Therefore, the discontinuity at $x=2$ is a jump discontinuity.\n\nConsequently, I is true, and II and III are false." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-38712/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "07b63c0c-daaa-5f5b-acb3-58d6f36ee869"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-38712"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "6294b263-59a7-56d7-84d5-4f97b2ef5fcb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "485cae68-ccb0-5289-aec8-cee3e919c42f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "eb331c7b-7a6d-53a1-9717-62f4a371ae7c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "f6546cb1-dd43-5bfc-adb4-77f5b86a9bc6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "d00ccab5-32c8-5994-ae8f-21a4e25027c0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-48187/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "940e0936-d7e3-5b08-9611-25bcabaceac3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radi